    {
      "height": 240,
      "id": "1bc63f7e823b00d5",
      "styleAttributes": {
      },
      "text": "# Notes\n\n- The leftmost is a \"neutral state\", representing the start of a cycle\n- From any given bot state, you can progress to the next gameplay state\n- At the rightmost side, a cycle is \"reset\" to the neutral state, and you start over\n- Each state represents some notable change in field state or game piece state\n",
      "type": "text",
      "width": 660,
